  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalizing the concept of the Great Green Wall of Cities Initiative (GGWC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO will carry out a number of preparatory activities, including surveys and studies for the development, submission and implementation of specific country/region project proposals contributing to the operationalization of the Great Green Wall of Cities Initiative (GGWC). FAO will also develop an ?extended? concept note for the GGWC, will formalize and expand the original partnership created around the GGWC idea, develop communications material and identify and engage resource partners and lead/early adopter cities, towards a concrete implementation on the ground of the GGWC.</narrative>
  </description>
